    sa: ["Why does Jesus say sin comes from the heart?", ["heart", "root", "desire", "attitude", "action", "inside"], "A good answer says actions flow from inner desires and attitudes, so outward rule-keeping cannot cure the problem and the heart needs to be changed."],
